this project's.

The files under `Legendre/Nagura/` are adapted from the MIT-licensed Lean
project <https://github.com/ShouqiaoW/erdos> (commit
`d28713ac8245ca86a686b8c67370a8d19d81b242`), which formalizes J. Nagura's
1952 proof.  The original MIT license text is retained in
`Legendre/Nagura/LICENSE`, and those adapted files remain available under the
MIT license; the rest of this repository remains Apache-2.0.

No paper PDFs or scans are included.  Bibliographic references and links are in
`docs/literature.md`.

